--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8ef4a382a350f98438c21cfd3c789fdf, type: 3}
  m_Name: Liberties1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lessonTitle: Liberties 1
  lessonId: liberties1
  slides:
  - slideName: Slide 1
    slideType: 0
    bodyText: Of course, stones placed on the board aren't immortal. They all have
      "liberties". If a stone or a group of stones runs out of liberties, they are
      captured, or taken off the board.
    boardSource: 1
    boardJsonFile: {fileID: 4900000, guid: cbf5d3bbfcdfe9d41bd8da8451bde56e, type: 3}
    inlineBoardSize: 9
    inlineCurrentPlayer: 2
    inlineBoardFlat: 
    inlineAnnotationTypeFlat: 
    inlineAnnotationNumberFlat: 
    correctYesAnswer: 1
    correctNumberAnswer: 0
  - slideName: Slide 2
    slideType: 0
    bodyText: Liberties are empty intersections orthogonally (that is, intersections
      to the left, right, up, or down of the stone, not diagonal) next to stones.
      For example, this stone has 4 liberties as shown.
    boardSource: 1
    boardJsonFile: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 979bfac1bf749ec49ac8bc33efe20e20, type: 3}
    inlineBoardSize: 9
    inlineCurrentPlayer: 1
    inlineBoardFlat: 
    inlineAnnotationTypeFlat: 
    inlineAnnotationNumberFlat: 
    correctYesAnswer: 1
    correctNumberAnswer: 0
  - slideName: Slide 3
    slideType: 0
    bodyText: When there are stones orthogonally next to a stone of the same color,
      they are considered one group of stones and share liberties. The two black
      stones on the right count as a group and has 6 liberties.
    boardSource: 1
    boardJsonFile: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 037900f09e92adf41993130ad7782f96, type: 3}
    inlineBoardSize: 9
    inlineCurrentPlayer: 1
    inlineBoardFlat: 
    inlineAnnotationTypeFlat: 
    inlineAnnotationNumberFlat: 
    correctYesAnswer: 1
    correctNumberAnswer: 0
  - slideName: Slide 4
    slideType: 0
    bodyText: ' However, the two white stones on the left are not a group due to
      not being orthogonally connected.'
    boardSource: 1
    boardJsonFile: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 037900f09e92adf41993130ad7782f96, type: 3}
    inlineBoardSize: 9
    inlineCurrentPlayer: 1
    inlineBoardFlat: 
    inlineAnnotationTypeFlat: 
    inlineAnnotationNumberFlat: 
    correctYesAnswer: 1
    correctNumberAnswer: 0
  - slideName: Slide 5
    slideType: 3
    bodyText: Comprehension check! How many liberties does this group of black stones
      have?
    boardSource: 1
    boardJsonFile: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 176631b323471aa48a0c9bd7d19918b3, type: 3}
    inlineBoardSize: 9
    inlineCurrentPlayer: 1
    inlineBoardFlat: 
    inlineAnnotationTypeFlat: 
    inlineAnnotationNumberFlat: 
    correctYesAnswer: 1
    correctNumberAnswer: 8
  - slideName: Slide 6
    slideType: 0
    bodyText: That's right!
    boardSource: 1
    boardJsonFile: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 176631b323471aa48a0c9bd7d19918b3, type: 3}
    inlineBoardSize: 9
    inlineCurrentPlayer: 1
    inlineBoardFlat: 
    inlineAnnotationTypeFlat: 
    inlineAnnotationNumberFlat: 
    correctYesAnswer: 1
    correctNumberAnswer: 8
  - slideName: Slide 7
    slideType: 2
    bodyText: Are these white stones one group?
    boardSource: 0
    boardJsonFile: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 176631b323471aa48a0c9bd7d19918b3, type: 3}
    inlineBoardSize: 9
    inlineCurrentPlayer: 1
    inlineBoardFlat: 
    inlineAnnotationTypeFlat: 
    inlineAnnotationNumberFlat: 
    correctYesAnswer: 1
    correctNumberAnswer: 0
  - slideName: Slide 8
    slideType: 3
    bodyText: Correct! Now, how many liberties does it have?
    boardSource: 0
    boardJsonFile: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 176631b323471aa48a0c9bd7d19918b3, type: 3}
    inlineBoardSize: 9
    inlineCurrentPlayer: 1
    inlineBoardFlat: 
    inlineAnnotationTypeFlat: 
    inlineAnnotationNumberFlat: 
    correctYesAnswer: 1
    correctNumberAnswer: 10
  - slideName: Slide 9
    slideType: 0
    bodyText: Correct again! That was a tough one.
    boardSource: 1
    boardJsonFile: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 176631b323471aa48a0c9bd7d19918b3, type: 3}
    inlineBoardSize: 9
    inlineCurrentPlayer: 1
    inlineBoardFlat: 
    inlineAnnotationTypeFlat: 
    inlineAnnotationNumberFlat: 
    correctYesAnswer: 1
    correctNumberAnswer: 10
  - slideName: Slide 10
    slideType: 2
    bodyText: Are these black stones one group?
    boardSource: 0
    boardJsonFile: {fileID: 4900000, guid: ca63c22c5b1b0304688c8d3f61ad0b52, type: 3}
    inlineBoardSize: 9
    inlineCurrentPlayer: 1
    inlineBoardFlat: 
    inlineAnnotationTypeFlat: 
    inlineAnnotationNumberFlat: 
    correctYesAnswer: 0
    correctNumberAnswer: 0
  - slideName: Slide 11
    slideType: 0
    bodyText: Precisely. Notice how they are not connected orthogonally. Remember
      diagonals doesn't count.
    boardSource: 0
    boardJsonFile: {fileID: 4900000, guid: ca63c22c5b1b0304688c8d3f61ad0b52, type: 3}
    inlineBoardSize: 9
    inlineCurrentPlayer: 1
    inlineBoardFlat: 
    inlineAnnotationTypeFlat: 
    inlineAnnotationNumberFlat: 
    correctYesAnswer: 1
    correctNumberAnswer: 0
  - slideName: Slide 12
    slideType: 2
    bodyText: One more practice. Are these black stones one group?
    boardSource: 1
    boardJsonFile: {fileID: 4900000, guid: ca63c22c5b1b0304688c8d3f61ad0b52, type: 3}
    inlineBoardSize: 9
    inlineCurrentPlayer: 1
    inlineBoardFlat: 
    inlineAnnotationTypeFlat: 
    inlineAnnotationNumberFlat: 
    correctYesAnswer: 1
    correctNumberAnswer: 0
  - slideName: Slide 13
    slideType: 3
    bodyText: 'How many liberties does it have? This is the hardest one so far. Hint:
      it''s less than 36'
    boardSource: 1
    boardJsonFile: {fileID: 4900000, guid: ca63c22c5b1b0304688c8d3f61ad0b52, type: 3}
    inlineBoardSize: 9
    inlineCurrentPlayer: 1
    inlineBoardFlat: 
    inlineAnnotationTypeFlat: 
    inlineAnnotationNumberFlat: 
    correctYesAnswer: 1
    correctNumberAnswer: 32
  - slideName: Slide 14
    slideType: 0
    bodyText: Good job! You're so good at this already.
    boardSource: 1
    boardJsonFile: {fileID: 4900000, guid: ca63c22c5b1b0304688c8d3f61ad0b52, type: 3}
    inlineBoardSize: 9
    inlineCurrentPlayer: 1
    inlineBoardFlat: 
    inlineAnnotationTypeFlat: 
    inlineAnnotationNumberFlat: 
    correctYesAnswer: 1
    correctNumberAnswer: 32
  - slideName: Slide 15
    slideType: 0
    bodyText: Learn about how liberties are reduced in the next lesson. see you soon!
    boardSource: 1
    boardJsonFile: {fileID: 4900000, guid: ca63c22c5b1b0304688c8d3f61ad0b52, type: 3}
    inlineBoardSize: 9
    inlineCurrentPlayer: 1
    inlineBoardFlat: 
    inlineAnnotationTypeFlat: 
    inlineAnnotationNumberFlat: 
    correctYesAnswer: 1
    correctNumberAnswer: 32
